1420/extras/302ef3baf4224ca09a9e493f458ee4f2.poster.avif?t=1755363909\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/302ef3baf4224ca09a9e493f458ee4f2.webm?t=1755363909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/302ef3baf4224ca09a9e493f458ee4f2.mp4?t=1755363909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one ball always bouncing around and one goal in the centre of each arena, Touching the ball will absorb it and turn it to your team colour, Red or Blue. The ball is purple when neutral. If you shoot the ball into the goal without hitting an obstacle, You score for your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/bb18c5978df508d4730913c9463f9943.poster.avif?t=1755363909\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/bb18c5978df508d4730913c9463f9943.webm?t=1755363909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/bb18c5978df508d4730913c9463f9943.mp4?t=1755363909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different arenas provide different obstacles and different ways of moving and fighting, for example curved arenas, let you add driving up the walls to all your other methods of moving, jumping, boosting and flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/34eba21b7c9e3c2b2c441509f99dd3ef.poster.avif?t=1755363909\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati